# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets ----
# NEVER remove these. CLAUDE.md's Build & Run tells you to put the hosted
# Postgres password in .env.local AT THE REPO ROOT. Until 2026-08-13 that was
# not ignored: supabase/.gitignore covers supabase/.env.local only, and the root
# had no .env rule at all, so one `git add -A` would have published the database
# password to a GitHub repo. Nothing was leaked (the file did not exist yet and
# no .env has ever been committed, verified with
# `git log --all --diff-filter=A --name-only`), but the doc had been asserting
# a protection that did not exist. A claim is not a control.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.DS_Store
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
build/
.derived/
Local.xcconfig
FXETennis.xcodeproj/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# XcodeGen output (regenerate with: xcodegen generate)
*.xcodeproj
.build/
DerivedData/
